SOURCE MATERIAL

  Referent 256 (referent_256.json):
  Extracted from "La Livrée d'Hermès" (Amiot, 2026), page 047 (SVG source).
  256 geometrically distinct forms from the ansate cross method for order-6
  magic squares. Computationally verified.

  Referent 360 (referent_360.json):
  Extracted from the KRE-360 Jacquard layer collection (Amiot, 2026).
  294 forms extracted (of 360 theoretical), structured as 15 harmonic types
  × 24 cards. The Yi King classification used in the source book is an
  arbitrary pedagogical protocol; any other classification yielding 360
  distinct, identifiable forms is equally valid as Referent 360.

