HISTORICAL NOTE

  The geometric constructions underlying this system were originally developed
  for research in arithmogeometry and Jacquard textile design over a period of
  twenty years, starting from a question in juggling and martial arts about
  how to cover 8 directions while preserving the momentum of movement.
  The cryptographic application is a structural consequence of the mathematical
  properties of the geometric forms — not its original purpose.

  "Afin que tous sachent qu'il était sous la protection du dieu, il portait
  la propre livrée de Mercure, que les clowns avaient faite pour lui."
